							property="ModuleCreateDiaryRecord_F_Description";
							expression="_this setVariable ['Description',_value,true];";
							class Value
							{
								class data
								{
									singleType="STRING";
									value="<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>SITUATION</font> " \n " " \n "<br/><br/> " \n " " \n "Zargabad is in civil war as insurgents from within the region have been brought together by a new leader. They have pushed the local military out of the town. Zargabad has been mostly evacuated of civilians and shelled by the military. There's also a sand storm rolling in. " \n " " \n "<br/><br/> " \n " " \n "<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>ENEMY</font> " \n " " \n "<br/><br/> " \n " " \n "We have one priority; the safe extraction of our client, anyone that gets in the way of that is consided hostile. " \n " " \n "<br/><br/> " \n " " \n "<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>MISSION</font> " \n " " \n "<br/><br/> " \n " " \n "Our client was was unable to evacuate as his villa was being attacked by insurgents. Over the radio we heard that him and one of his bodyguards managed to escape. We haven't heard from them since. Your mission is to search the villa for evidence that may point to where he may be and then extract him.";
								};
							};
						};
